<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boy, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nIt’s damn near noon!\fYour lil homie Lyra came by.\rShe was out there playin’ hide n\nseek with her MARILL.\rOh, and that weird science man\nnext door, Elm, was lookin’ for you.\rSaid he need a favor. Probably\nwant you to hold somethin’.\rI know you know where the lab is.\nIt’s the house that smell funny.\rAnd don’t go out there lookin’\nbroke. Your daddy did enough of that.\fHere. Take this Bag...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Girl, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nIt’s damn near noon!\fYour lil homie Ethan came by.\rHe was out there playin’ hide n\nseek with his MARILL.\rOh, and that weird science man\nnext door, Elm, was lookin’ for you.\rSaid he need a favor. Probably\nwant you to hold somethin’.\rI know you know where the lab is.\nIt’s the house that smell funny.\rAnd don’t go out there lookin’\nbroke. Your daddy did enough of that.\fHere. Take this Bag...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s your Trainer Card. That’s\nmore ID than your daddy ever had...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is where you save your\nprogress. Unlike your daddy...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">These come in handy too, baby...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just mash the buttons. You’ll\nfigure it out. You always do.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Elm still waitin’ on you, baby.\nGo ’head before he call again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWho’s this lil thing with you?\rElm gave it to you? For free?\nNothin’ in this town is free.\rHe got a job for you, too?\fWhat kinda job?\r...\rMm-hm. Sounds like a setup.\rBut when grown folks ask you for\na favor, you handle it. Respect.\rOh! Hold on!\nI almost forgot!\rYour Pokégear came back from the\nshop! I had to pawn the TV for it!\rHere you go!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Pokégear back from the pawn shop!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokémon Gear...\nor Pokégear, if you nasty,\fis what every hustler needs.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Guess what?\nYou can make calls on it, too.\fUnlike your daddy, who never\fcalls. You know how? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just turn on the Pokégear and\ntap the phone button. Easy.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hit the POKéGEAR button on the\nTouch Screen. Then hit the\fphone button.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everybody you meet gets saved in\nthere automatic.\rJust pick a name and call ’em.\nCall your mama sometimes, too.\rLord, if your daddy had one of\nthese he’d STILL find an excuse.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you doin’ back here?\rYou forgot how to get to\nMr. Pokémon’s spot?\rGo north on Route 30.\nAnd don’t talk to strangers. Much.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\nSo you finna leave too, huh...\rEverybody leaves. The milk man.\nYour daddy. Your daddy again.\rFine. I’ma help, though.\nI know! Every time you win bread,\fI’ll stash some for you.\rOn the road, bread is everything.\rWant me to hold\nyour money for you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’ma always ride for you,\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. Always.\fNot like SOME people.\fBut what can I do for you?\rI know!\rEvery time you win some bread,\nI’ll stash some of it for you.\rOn the road, bread is everything.\nWant me to hold\fyour money for you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, I got your money.\rI won’t touch it. Promise.\rYour homies is your family.\nWhen y’all ride together,\fcan’t nobody stop y’all!\fNow go ’head!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight. Hold your own bread then.\rYour homies is your family.\nWhen y’all ride together,\fcan’t nobody stop y’all!\fNow go ’head!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, stay up!\nMama got you. Always.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hey baby! Welcome home!\nYou lookin’ good, I see.\rI kept your room clean. Your daddy’s\nside of the closet still empty...\fYou here about your money? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just do what you can, baby.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh!\nYou ain’t got nothin’ saved.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your bread is safe with me!\nStay safe out there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\nDon’t blow it all on sneakers!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna stash some bread? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh!\nYou ain’t got no bread to stash.\rDon’t be wastin’ money on\ndumb stuff like your daddy, OK?\rYou got sense like me.\nI know I can count on you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I done stashed so much.\nThe mattress is full, baby.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got enough already.\nI ain’t givin’ you no more.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TAKE BREAD</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">STASH BREAD</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CHANGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">EXIT</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nElm called. Say he\fgot somethin’ for you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Elm say he got somethin’ for you.\nIf it’s a bill, don’t sign it.\fGo see him at the lab.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The TV is playing a movie!\rTwo dudes in a cave lookin’\nfor treasure... and a dad!\rI better get goin’...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mama’s famous Cinnabar Burger!\nDaddy left before he tried it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A squeaky-clean sink!\nMama cleans when she stressed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0545_T20R0201_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s in the fridge...?\rTap water and a whole jug of\nsweeeet tea! And one lonely egg.</language>
	</row>
</body>
